{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SLZJG4iZx955byLgayHzEa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Plan 010: Architecture-Stratified DIF Analysis\n2\t\n3\t## 1. Motivation\n4\t\n5\tPlan 001 found 31.3% ETS C items in temporal MH-DIF (2023 vs 2024) across all\n6\t5227 METABENCH MMLU models. A reviewer concern: the model population spans\n7\tmultiple architectures (decoder-only, encoder-decoder, encoder-only), and this\n8\theterogeneity may cause IRT model misfit, inflating DIF flags. This analysis\n9\tverifies DIF findings on an architecture-homogeneous (decoder-only) subset.\n10\t\n11\t## 2. Architecture Classification\n12\t\n13\tModels were classified based on known family labels and model name patterns:\n14\t\n15\t| Architecture | N | % |\n16\t|-------------|---|---|\n17\t| decoder-only | 5226 | 100.0% |\n18\t| encoder-decoder | 1 | 0.0% |\n19\t\n20\t**Key finding**: METABENCH draws from the Open LLM Leaderboard, which evaluates\n21\tgenerative language models on MMLU. Virtually all models are decoder-only.\n22\t\n23\tExcluded non-decoder-only models (1):\n24\t- `AurelPx/Pegasus-7b-slerp` (encoder-decoder)\n25\t\n26\t## 3. Decoder-Only Subset Description\n27\t\n28\t- **Total decoder-only models**: 5226\n29\t- **Temporal cohort split**:\n30\t  - 2023: N = 1080\n31\t  - 2024: N = 807\n32\t  - other: N = 3339\n33\t- **Reference (2023)**: N = 1080\n34\t- **Focal (2024)**: N = 807\n35\t\n36\t## 4. IRT Fit Diagnostics\n37\t\n38\t### 4.1 Item-Level Fit: Point-Biserial Correlations\n39\t\n40\t| Metric | Full Population | Decoder-Only |\n41\t|--------|----------------|--------------|\n42\t| N models | 5227 | 5226 |\n43\t| rpb mean | 0.3993 | 0.3993 |\n44\t| rpb median | 0.5118 | 0.5118 |\n45\t| rpb SD | 0.3439 | 0.3439 |\n46\t| Items with rpb < 0 | 1926 | 1926 |\n47\t\n48\tInterpretation: Point-biserial correlations measure how well each item discriminates\n49\talong the latent trait (total score). Similar distributions between full and\n50\tdecoder-only populations indicate that architecture heterogeneity does not\n51\tmeaningfully affect item-level IRT fit.\n52\t\n53\t### 4.2 Person-Level Fit: Standardized Residuals (Lz proxy)\n54\t\n55\t| Metric | Full Population | Decoder-Only |\n56\t|--------|----------------|--------------|\n57\t| Lz mean | -0.0000 | 0.0000 |\n58\t| Lz SD | 44.6150 | 44.6153 |\n59\t| \\|Lz\\| > 2 | 5125 (98.0%) | 5124 (98.0%) |\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43ea3076-440c-4e48-9471-1c78687f25f0","uuid":"a7752d80-abe8-475d-a3bd-9e3d3cc652d6","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:07:52.191Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_010/plan_010_report.md","content":"# Plan 010: Architecture-Stratified DIF Analysis\n\n## 1. Motivation\n\nPlan 001 found 31.3% ETS C items in temporal MH-DIF (2023 vs 2024) across all\n5227 METABENCH MMLU models. A reviewer concern: the model population spans\nmultiple architectures (decoder-only, encoder-decoder, encoder-only), and this\nheterogeneity may cause IRT model misfit, inflating DIF flags. This analysis\nverifies DIF findings on an architecture-homogeneous (decoder-only) subset.\n\n## 2. Architecture Classification\n\nModels were classified based on known family labels and model name patterns:\n\n| Architecture | N | % |\n|-------------|---|---|\n| decoder-only | 5226 | 100.0% |\n| encoder-decoder | 1 | 0.0% |\n\n**Key finding**: METABENCH draws from the Open LLM Leaderboard, which evaluates\ngenerative language models on MMLU. Virtually all models are decoder-only.\n\nExcluded non-decoder-only models (1):\n- `AurelPx/Pegasus-7b-slerp` (encoder-decoder)\n\n## 3. Decoder-Only Subset Description\n\n- **Total decoder-only models**: 5226\n- **Temporal cohort split**:\n  - 2023: N = 1080\n  - 2024: N = 807\n  - other: N = 3339\n- **Reference (2023)**: N = 1080\n- **Focal (2024)**: N = 807\n\n## 4. IRT Fit Diagnostics\n\n### 4.1 Item-Level Fit: Point-Biserial Correlations\n\n| Metric | Full Population | Decoder-Only |\n|--------|----------------|--------------|\n| N models | 5227 | 5226 |\n| rpb mean | 0.3993 | 0.3993 |\n| rpb median | 0.5118 | 0.5118 |\n| rpb SD | 0.3439 | 0.3439 |\n| Items with rpb < 0 | 1926 | 1926 |\n\nInterpretation: Point-biserial correlations measure how well each item discriminates\nalong the latent trait (total score). Similar distributions between full and\ndecoder-only populations indicate that architecture heterogeneity does not\nmeaningfully affect item-level IRT fit.\n\n### 4.2 Person-Level Fit: Standardized Residuals (Lz proxy)\n\n| Metric | Full Population | Decoder-Only |\n|--------|----------------|--------------|\n| Lz mean | -0.0000 | 0.0000 |\n| Lz SD | 44.6150 | 44.6153 |\n| \\|Lz\\| > 2 | 5125 (98.0%) | 5124 (98.0%) |\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":129}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017XzUn2wB41hP1UvfCedwZH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have sufficient context. Let me produce the full detailed median-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Core finding (31.3% instability) and semi-synthetic validation framework survive intact.\n  Meta-critique (Claim 2) is viewed by at least one reviewer as \"obvious in retrospect\" —\n  enrichment≈1.0 is unsurprising to anyone already skeptical of web-overlap labels.\n  GSM1K correlation (Claim 4d, N=33) is flagged as underpowered and demoted to supplementary.\n  One reviewer notes pseudo R²=0.0007 is suspiciously low and asks about model specification.\n  Actionable takeaway is insufficient — \"so what should practitioners do?\"\n  Rebuttal strategy: emphasize 31.3% + controls (plan_018/019/022/027) as the load-bearing\n  contribution; soften Claim 2 from \"fundamental blind spot\" to \"first empirical quantification\";\n  drop GSM1K from headline; add concrete DIF audit protocol for benchmark maintainers.\n  Acceptance probability 0.30–0.55; likely Findings-level (score 3.0–3.5) without strong rebuttal.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      MH-DIF analysis on METABENCH MMLU (5,227 models × 12,508 items).\n      Temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1), ability-quintile split, Li et al. proxy validation,\n      within-family confound control, domain-specificity analysis.\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n      temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n      ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      ability_enrichment: 1.19\n      within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n      within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n      domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n      sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，31.3% 核心发现成立并通过审稿。时间队列 DIF 反映了真实的 item 功能变化，\n      而非统计伪迹（随机分割仅 0.18%）。Li et al. 标签的 enrichment≈0.96 确认了 web-overlap 标签\n      与 DIF 正交——这在 median 档被接受为预期结果而非 DIF 失败的证据。能力五分位 C%=2.9% 远低于\n      时间队列的 31.3%，证明 DIF 信号是时间效应而非能力分层伪迹。within-family Llama-2v3 的\n      C%=61.3% 较高因为能力差距大（d=-0.99），但在 plan_027 匹配后降至 28.3%。\n      domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 表示领域改进与 DIF 有弱关联，但 plan_019 分解证明仅解释 2.4pp。\n      审稿人接受该发现为稳健的，但一位审稿人质疑 ETS C 的 |Δ_MH|≥1.5 阈值是否适合 LLM 人群，\n      要求看不同阈值下的结果（引向 plan_018）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary — C/B/A 分布 across 12,508 items\"\n      - \"Table 2: Cohort × DIF cross-tabulation (2023 N=1,080 vs 2024 N=807)\"\n      - \"Table 3: Domain-specificity — top/bottom 10 subjects by C%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: |Δ_MH| distribution histogram with ETS A/B/C cutoffs marked\"\n      - \"Fig 2: Subject C% vs subject accuracy delta scatter (ρ=0.307)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心实验，在 median 档完全成立。31.3% C% 经受住了所有 robustness 检验（阈值、\n      多重检验、架构、能力分解、模型独立性）。审稿人的主要挑战不在于数字本身，而在于\n      \"31% instability 意味着什么\"——是否有 actionable 的下游影响。enrichment≈0.96 对 Claim 2\n      来说是关键证据，但在 median 档审稿人可能认为这个 null result 本身并不令人惊讶。\n\n  - name: rl_robustness_validation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      验证 DIF 对 RL 训练模型的鲁棒性。在 METABENCH 中分离 SFT-only、alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)、\n      reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO) 模型，比较 DIF 检测一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_only_cohort_n: 312\n      alignment_rl_cohort_n: 477\n      reasoning_rl_n_available: 13\n      dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_alignrl: 0.72\n      dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_full: 0.85\n      reasoning_rl_added_c_pct_change: -0.4\n      constat_auroc_on_sft: 0.68\n      constat_auroc_on_rl: 0.53\n      mink_auroc_on_sft: 0.61\n      mink_auroc_on_rl: 0.47\n      tost_equivalence_dif_retention: \"p=0.08, inconclusive\"\n      bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_dif_vs_constat: \"[-0.05, 0.18]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，DIF 对 alignment-RL 模型表现稳定（Jaccard=0.72），因为 DPO/ORPO 不改变\n      NLL gap 结构。但 reasoning-RL 样本仅 13 个模型，严重不足以支撑任何统计结论。\n      将 13 个 reasoning-RL 模型加入 focal 队列后 C% 变化仅 -0.4pp，技术上\"稳健\"但\n      审稿人正确指出这不等于验证——13 个模型被 800+ 其他模型淹没。TOST 等价性检验\n      不显著（p=0.08），留下不确定性。传统检测器（ConStat、Min-K%）在 RL 模型上\n      AUROC 下降约 0.10-0.15，但 CI 宽，bootstrap 差异含零。\n      在 median 档这个实验被认为\"不够有力\"——N=13 reasoning-RL 的限制被视为致命缺陷，\n      整个 RL robustness 论述被降级为 future work 而非正式 claim。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: DIF flag overlap across SFT/alignment-RL/reasoning-RL cohort compositions\"\n      - \"Table: Per-detector AUROC comparison (DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K%) across model types\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Receiver operating characteristic curves for 3 detectors × 3 model subsets\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=13 reasoning-RL 模型是不可克服的瓶颈。在 median 档审稿人接受 alignment-RL 部分但\n      认为核心 claim（DIF 对 reasoning-RL 鲁棒）未被验证。这个实验最终不进入 main body，\n      在 limitations 中提及为\"initial evidence, insufficient for formal claim\"。\n      GPU 预算 100h 大部分用于推理 10-15 个开源 GRPO/PPO 模型跑 MMLU，结果数据量不够\n      支撑统计检验。\n\n  - name: constat_perturbation_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003a\n    description: >\n      独立评估 ConStat 式 perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的检测能力。\n      生成 200+ MMLU 题目的语义等价改写，比较原始/改写表现，FDR 控制检测。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_reformulated: 237\n      n_models_tested: 50\n      perturbation_detection_rate_overall: 0.14\n      perturbation_detection_rate_suspected_contaminated: 0.23\n      perturbation_detection_rate_clean: 0.09\n      fdr_controlled_detections: 34\n      mean_accuracy_drop_original_to_perturbed: 0.031\n      mean_accuracy_drop_suspected: 0.058\n      mean_accuracy_drop_clean: 0.012\n      constat_dif_flag_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，ConStat 式方法在 MMLU 4 选 1 格式上受限——perturbation 空间受限于\n      问题改写而非选项重排（MMLU 选项本身是固定的），导致 signal 较弱。\n      整体检测率仅 14%，在疑似污染 items 上稍高（23%）但仍远低于 DIF 的 31.3%。\n      accuracy drop 均值仅 3.1pp，信噪比低。ConStat 与 DIF 标记的 Jaccard=0.11 极低，\n      验证了两种方法捕获不同维度的信号——ConStat 检测个体模型的 verbatim 记忆，\n      DIF 检测群体层面的差异功能。这个结果在 median 档被认为\"有信息量但不 compelling\"，\n      最终作为 baseline comparison 放入 appendix/supplementary 而非 main body。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: ConStat detection rates by contamination status (Li et al. labels)\"\n      - \"Table: ConStat vs DIF flag confusion matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Accuracy drop distribution (original → perturbed) for flagged vs unflagged items\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat 在 MMLU 上表现不佳的根本原因是 MMLU 的 4-choice MCQ 格式限制了 perturbation\n      效果。改写后语义保持但表面形式变化有限，模型的正确率下降不够大。在 median 档\n      审稿人可能质疑 perturbation 质量，但更根本的问题是 ConStat 设计用于检测 verbatim\n      记忆而非 differential functioning，所以低 overlap 是 expected 而非 failure。\n      这个实验消耗 80h GPU 但产出有限，属于 negative-but-informative result。\n\n  - name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003b\n    description: >\n      独立评估 DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上的检测能力。\n      10-15 个开源模型每题生成 50 次 response，计算 generation variance，检测双峰分布。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_tested: 12\n      n_items_evaluated: 12508\n      bimodal_detection_rate: 0.07\n      bimodal_on_dif_c_items: 0.09\n      bimodal_on_non_dif_items: 0.06\n      variance_score_dif_c_mean: 0.342\n      variance_score_non_dif_mean: 0.318\n      variance_diff_effect_size_d: 0.12\n      dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上表现最差。4-choice MCQ 的 generation\n      variance 本质上受限于离散分布——模型要么选对要么选错，temperature sampling 在\n      MCQ 上产生的 variance 主要反映模型 confidence 而非 contamination signal。\n      bimodal 检测率仅 7%，DIF-C 与 non-DIF items 差异极小（d=0.12），overlap Jaccard=0.04\n      说明两种方法几乎完全独立。DVD 设计初衷是开放生成任务（如代码生成），在 MCQ 上\n      先天不适用。在 median 档这个结果迅速确认 DVD 不适用于 MMLU 评估，实验结论明确但\n      对论文贡献有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Generation variance summary statistics by DIF category\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Variance score distributions for DIF-C vs non-DIF items (near-complete overlap)\"\n    analysis: >\n      DVD 在 MCQ 上的理论限制是预期内的——generation variance 对 MCQ 格式本身不适配。\n      这 70h GPU 产出 negative result，在论文中仅作为一句话提及（\"DVD generation variance\n      is designed for open-ended tasks and shows near-zero signal on MCQ benchmarks\"）。\n      审稿人不会挑战这个结论，但也不会因此给分。\n\n  - name: ensemble_fusion\n    plan_id: plan_003c\n    description: >\n      融合 DIF + ConStat + DVD 为多信号集成检测器。2-of-3 majority voting 和加权融合。\n    expected_results:\n      ensemble_attempted: false\n      reason: \"plan_003a 和 plan_003b 个体信号太弱，无法构建有意义的集成\"\n      constat_standalone_auroc: 0.58\n      dvd_standalone_auroc: 0.52\n      dif_standalone_auroc: \"N/A (group-level, not model-level)\"\n      notes: \"DIF 是群体层面方法，无法与 ConStat/DVD 在 item-model 粒度融合\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，ensemble fusion 因为两个根本问题而未完成：(1) plan_003a 和 plan_003b\n      的个体信号太弱（ConStat AUROC≈0.58, DVD AUROC≈0.52），集成无法从噪声中提取\n      信号；(2) 更根本的是，DIF 是群体层面方法（检测 item 在两个群体间的差异功能），\n      而 ConStat/DVD 是模型层面方法（检测单个模型的记忆），粒度不匹配导致融合框架\n      概念上不连贯。在 median 档这个实验被正确放弃，论文叙事从 \"ensemble detection\"\n      转向 \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"，避免了强行融合不可融合的方法。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble fusion 的失败不是实验失败而是概念重构——认识到 DIF 和 per-model detectors\n      回答不同问题（\"which items function differently\" vs \"which models memorized\"）。\n      这个认识反而强化了 Claim 2（meta-critique），因为它揭示了粒度不匹配问题。\n      在 median 档，审稿人不会批评未做的集成，因为论文已经 pivot 到 diagnostic lens 叙事。\n\n  - name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。\n      三步：(1) GSM8K temporal DIF, (2) semi-synthetic validation, (3) GSM1K 相关。\n    expected_results:\n      step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n      step1_n_items: 1319\n      step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      step3_n_models: 33\n      step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n      step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n      step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n      step3_spearman_p: 0.020\n      step3_partial_r: -0.385\n      step3_partial_p: 0.027\n      step3_bca_ci_pearson: \"[-0.714, -0.155]\"\n      step3_bca_ci_spearman: \"[-0.687, -0.031]\"\n      step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n      step3_cook_d_max: \"Deepseek-math-7b-rl\"\n      step3_leave_one_out_r_range: \"[-0.537, -0.374]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，GSM8K Step 1 和 Step 2 成功复制——temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 的\n      31.3%（合理，GSM8K 是单一数学领域，能力结构更均质），semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818\n      确认框架跨 benchmark 可移植性。\n\n      关键争议在 Step 3：r=-0.478 (p=0.005) 看似显著，但 N=33 导致 CI 极宽——\n      Pearson CI 上界 |r|=0.155 意味着真实效应可能很小，Spearman CI 上界 |ρ|=0.031\n      意味着几乎可以为零。在 median 档，至少一位审稿人指出：(a) N=33 严重不足，\n      (b) GSM1K contamination gap 本身是 proxy 而非 ground truth，(c) 反向相关的\n      因果解释不唯一——DIF-C items 可能仅因为更难而使 contaminated 模型在上面得分低。\n\n      审稿人建议将 Step 3 从 headline results 降级为 supplementary evidence。这与\n      median 档的 \"GSM1K correlation is discounted\" 假设一致。论文将 Step 3 用作\n      \"suggestive cross-benchmark evidence\" 而非 \"confirmation of contamination resistance\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GSM8K temporal DIF summary (1,319 items × 6,702 models)\"\n      - \"Table: Semi-synthetic ΔTPR dose-response on GSM8K\"\n      - \"Table: GSM1K correlation statistics with CIs (moved to appendix in median)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GSM8K |Δ_MH| distribution vs MMLU comparison\"\n      - \"Fig: DIF-C item score vs GSM1K gap scatter (N=33, wide CIs visible)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K 复制的 Step 1+2 在 median 档完全成立并进入 main body。Step 3 是 median 档\n      最大的弱点之一——N=33, wide CIs, causal ambiguity。在 rebuttal 中不应试图捍卫\n      Step 3 的 headline 地位，而应主动将其定位为 \"preliminary cross-benchmark evidence\n      that motivates larger-scale replication\"。这样做既诚实又保护了论文的 credibility。\n\n  - name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      在 METABENCH MMLU 上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），\n      选择 anchor items，通过 fixed-parameter calibration 进行 equating。\n    expected_results:\n      bifactor_convergence: false\n      convergence_attempts: 3\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_rmsea: 0.089\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_cfi: 0.71\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_srmr: 0.112\n      full_57_factor_status: \"non-convergence after 5000 EM iterations\"\n      anchor_item_selection: \"N/A — model did not converge\"\n      equating_completed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，bifactor IRT 在 MMLU 上面临两个结构性障碍：(1) 57 个 subject-specific\n      factors 的参数空间巨大（12,508 items × 58 factors），EM 算法在 5,227 个 models 上\n      无法收敛；(2) 即使在 5 个 subjects 子集上部分拟合，fit indices 也不达标\n      （RMSEA>0.08, CFI<0.90），因为 MMLU 本身是知识测验而非心理测量量表——item 之间\n      的 local independence 假设被 subject 内的 topic clustering 严重违反。\n      plan_013 的 Q3 分析已显示 within-subject 有 11.3% 的 item pairs 违反 local independence。\n      bifactor 模型无法修复这个根本问题。实验被 kill 前仅消耗约 15h GPU（远低于 50h 预算），\n      合理止损。在 median 档论文将此作为 limitations 中 \"empirical observation\" 的一部分，\n      motivation for future multidimensional IRT work。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Bifactor 失败是 median 档 \"Claim 3 (regeneration) dropped entirely\" 的直接原因。\n      没有 bifactor equating，就没有 principled 的 anchor item 选择方法，整个 regeneration\n      pipeline 缺乏基础。这个 negative result 对论文 framing 的影响是积极的——\n      它迫使论文从 \"we can fix benchmarks\" 转向 \"we can diagnose benchmarks\"，\n      后者更诚实也更 defensible。\n\n  - name: item_generation_calibration\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      为 DIF-flagged MMLU 题目生成替代题目，通过 student simulation 进行难度校准。\n    expected_results:\n      experiment_executed: false\n      reason: \"plan_005 (bifactor IRT) failed — no calibration targets available\"\n      dependency_chain_broken: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，plan_005 的失败导致 plan_006 从未启动。没有 bifactor 模型提供的\n      item parameter targets，LLM 生成的替代题目无法与原始题目在 IRT 参数空间对齐。\n      仅靠 CTT difficulty (p-value) 匹配不足以保证 construct equivalence。\n      这 200h GPU 预算完全未使用。论文中不提及此实验（未执行 = 无结果可报告），\n      但 regeneration 方向作为 \"promising future work\" 出现在 conclusion 中。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_006 的缺失不影响 median 档论文质量——paper 已 pivot away from regeneration。\n      但审稿人中有一位可能会问 \"so what should practitioners do with these DIF flags?\"\n      without replacement items, the answer is weak. This is one of the 1-2 claims\n      needing softening in median tier — the diagnostic lens framing needs a concrete\n      protocol (DIF audit checklist) to fill the actionability gap.\n\n  - name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      实现 Sinharay et al. (2006) 累积贝叶斯 DIF 先验。模拟 4 次连续 benchmark\n      administration，展示累积证据下的 power 提升。\n    expected_results:\n      simulation_only: true\n      single_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n      cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.58\n      cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.71\n      cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.79\n      effect_size_simulated: 1.0\n      n_per_admin: 100\n      prior_shrinkage_on_small_effects: 0.35\n      bayesian_fpr_vs_frequentist: \"0.028 vs 0.042\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，cumulative Bayesian DIF 是纯模拟实验，展示理论上的 power 提升：\n      单次 administration 对 medium effects (δ=1.0) 的 power 仅 0.42，但 3 次累积后\n      达到 0.71——超过了 MH 在 N=80, δ=1.4 时的 0.68。Bayesian shrinkage 还将小效应\n      的 FPR 从 0.042 降至 0.028。但这全部是模拟结果，没有在 METABENCH 真实数据上\n      验证（因为只有 2 个时间点，不够 4 次 administration）。在 median 档审稿人承认\n      理论价值但认为 \"simulation without real validation is supplementary at best\"。\n      这个实验被放入 appendix，作为 future monitoring framework 的理论基础。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): Power by # administrations × effect size (simulation grid)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): Power accumulation curves — 1 to 4 administrations at δ={0.5, 1.0, 1.5}\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cumulative Bayesian DIF 在 median 档被视为 \"nice to have\" 而非必要。审稿人不会\n      批评这个 idea 本身，但会认为没有 real-data validation 就无法支撑论文 claim。\n      零 GPU 消耗（纯模拟），投入产出比合理作为 supplementary material。\n\n  - name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      分析 benchmark 在 item 替换下的 validity degradation。\n      定义 validity metrics，模拟渐进替换（5%-50%），建立理论 bounds。\n    expected_results:\n      replacement_items_available: false\n      degradation_only_analysis: true\n      removal_5pct_rho: 0.9994\n      removal_10pct_rho: 0.9987\n      removal_20pct_rho: 0.9971\n      removal_31pct_rho: 0.9965\n      removal_50pct_rho: 0.9921\n      shr_degradation_31pct: -0.0015\n      construct_coverage_31pct: \"54/57 subjects retained ≥70% items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，由于 plan_005/006 失败，无替代 items 可用，graceful degradation\n      只能分析 removal（不含 replacement）。结果高度积极：即使移除 31% DIF-C items，\n      ranking stability 仍 ρ=0.9965——这直接支撑了 \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。\n      50% 移除后仍 ρ>0.99，证明 MMLU 有极大的 measurement redundancy。\n\n      但这个分析本质上与 plan_017 高度重叠（plan_017 已报告 ρ=0.996-0.999）。\n      在 median 档审稿人不会为 redundant results 给额外分数。graceful degradation\n      的独特贡献——construct coverage 分析（54/57 subjects retain ≥70% items）——\n      是一个 small addition，放入 appendix。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): Ranking stability (ρ) and SHR as function of removal rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): ρ vs removal rate curve (near-horizontal at 0.99+ until 50%)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Graceful degradation 的核心发现已被 plan_017 部分报告。独立贡献有限但强化了\n      \"MMLU is massively redundant\" 的论点。在 median 档这作为 supplementary evidence\n      支持 Claim 4a (benchmark redundancy) 但不改变审稿评分。\n\n  - name: item_focused_trees\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      实现 Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees，将 model release date 作为\n      连续协变量替代 categorical cohort DIF。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_analyzed: 12508\n      ift_flagged_items_pct: 28.7\n      ift_mh_c_overlap_jaccard: 0.61\n      ift_unique_flags_pct: 4.2\n      mh_unique_flags_pct: 6.8\n      temporal_trend_significant_items_pct: 22.3\n      linear_trend_dominant: true\n      nonlinear_trend_items_pct: 6.4\n      advantage_over_mh: \"avoids arbitrary cohort boundary; captures gradual drift\"\n      disadvantage_vs_mh: \"computationally expensive; interpretation less transparent\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，IFT 提供了 DIF 的连续视角——28.7% items 被标记，与 MH 的 31.3%\n      有 Jaccard=0.61 的重叠。IFT 额外发现 4.2% 的 items 有 gradual drift 但未达\n      MH 的 C 阈值（effect 在 B 区间逐渐累积），同时 MH 标记的 6.8% items 在 IFT 中\n      不显著（可能是 MH 对 cohort boundary 的特殊性敏感）。22.3% 的 items 显示\n      statistically significant 的时间趋势（非平坦 ICCs across release dates）。\n\n      在 median 档审稿人认为 IFT 是 \"interesting robustness check\" 但不构成独立贡献——\n      核心发现（~30% items 功能不稳定）无论用 MH 还是 IFT 都成立。IFT 的计算成本\n      （每个 item 一棵 tree，12,508 棵）远高于 MH，但额外信息有限。\n      放入 appendix 作为 method robustness 证据。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): MH vs IFT flag comparison — 2×2 contingency table\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): IFT-derived DIF effect trajectory for 5 example items across release dates\"\n    analysis: >\n      IFT 确认 MH 发现的 robustness 但不改变结论。在 median 档审稿人可能欣赏方法论\n      thoroughness 但不会因此提高 novelty 评分。零 GPU 消耗，作为 supplementary 的\n      cost-benefit 比合理。\n\n  - name: architecture_stratified_dif\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      在 architecture-homogeneous (decoder-only) 子群上运行 DIF，检验 IRT 模型拟合\n      是否改善、spurious DIF 是否减少。\n    expected_results:\n      decoder_only_n: 5226\n      decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n      non_decoder_n: 1\n      c_pct_decoder_only: 31.3\n      c_pct_full: 31.3\n      jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n      rpb_mean_decoder: 0.3993\n      rpb_mean_full: 0.3993\n      lz_misfit_pct_decoder: 98.0\n      lz_misfit_pct_full: 98.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，architecture stratification 产生了最 anticlimactic 但最 clean 的\n      结果：METABENCH MMLU 中 99.98% 的模型是 decoder-only，仅 1 个 encoder-decoder\n      模型 (AurelPx/Pegasus-7b-slerp)。移除它后所有指标完全不变——C% 相同，\n      Jaccard=1.0，rpb 分布相同，person misfit 相同。这彻底排除了 architecture\n      heterogeneity 作为 DIF 伪迹来源。\n\n      但同时暴露了一个 separate 问题：98% 的模型 |Lz|>2 表明 1D IRT 本身对 MMLU\n      严重 misspecified——这不是 architecture 的问题，而是 MMLU 57 subjects 的\n      多维性本身。在 median 档审稿人接受 architecture 不是问题，但可能追问\n      \"if 98% of models misfit the IRT model, how valid are MH results at all?\"\n      论文回应：MH 不依赖 IRT model fit，它直接条件化 total score，是非参数方法。\n      Lz misfit 是 IRT 的问题，不是 MH 的问题。这个辩护在 median 档被接受但留\n      lingering doubt。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture composition of METABENCH MMLU\"\n      - \"Table: DIF results comparison — full vs decoder-only (identical)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: (Potentially omitted — showing identical results is not visually informative)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_010 的结果在 median 档是 strong defense against a weak attack——architecture\n      heterogeneity 从未真正是个问题因为数据集本身就是 homogeneous。但作为 proactive\n      defense（提前排除审稿人可能的 concern），这是 good practice。结果进入 main body\n      作为一句话 + footnote：\"METABENCH is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n      excluding the one non-decoder model yields identical results (Jaccard=1.0).\"\n\n  - name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      在真实 METABENCH response matrix 中注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 检测力。\n      变化注入参数：contamination prevalence, exploitation rate, focal group size。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n      temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n      temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.990\n      temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.000\n      temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10: 0.616\n      cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n      cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.000\n      within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.186\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      n_clean_items: 500\n      n_injected_items: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，semi-synthetic 实验是 Claim 3 的核心证据，成功展示了三个关键结果：\n      (1) DIF 对 injected contamination 有明确的 dose-response（ΔTPR 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0\n      单调增加），证明 DIF 能够检测 differential contamination；\n      (2) cross-subject matching 完全消除 FPR inflation（ΔFPR=0.000 across all 5 tested\n      subjects），而 standard/within-subject matching 导致 FPR 从 0.30 膨胀到 0.62——\n      这是 matching variable contamination 效应的直接证明；\n      (3) 基线 FPR=0.314 接近 plan_001 的 temporal C%=31.3%，这不是巧合——它反映了\n      真实数据中已存在的 temporal DIF（注入在 existing DIF 之上叠加）。\n\n      在 median 档，至少一位审稿人欣赏 cross-subject matching 的 innovation（\"subtle\n      and general insight about matching variable contamination\"），但另一位认为\n      semi-synthetic injection 过于简化（\"incorrect→correct flipping doesn't model\n      real contamination mechanisms\"）。论文在 limitations 中 acknowledge 这一点。\n      Semi-synthetic framework 被一位审稿人视为 \"useful but niche\"——对 DIF 研究者有价值\n      但对一般 NLP 社区影响有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: ΔTPR dose-response across exploitation rates p ∈ {0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 1.0}\"\n      - \"Table: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject vs within-subject matching\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curves for 3 matching strategies (FPR and TPR vs exploitation rate p)\"\n      - \"Fig: FPR inflation under standard matching vs stable FPR under cross-subject matching\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic validation 在 median 档是论文中技术最 clean 的贡献。cross-subject\n      matching 的 ΔFPR=0.000 结果是 elegant 的，提供了 concrete methodological recommendation。\n      但 \"niche\" 评价意味着这个贡献的 impact 被 discount——EMNLP 审稿人期望看到\n      broader implications for the NLP community, not just psychometric methodology refinement。\n      在 rebuttal 中应强调 framework 的 reusability：any future item-level detector\n      can use this semi-synthetic protocol for controlled validation。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":971,"cache_read_input_tokens":46827,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":971},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43ea3076-440c-4e48-9471-1c78687f25f0","uuid":"3bb794e7-7cd3-45fb-bd0e-d1ce8d3e251b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":300664,"duration_api_ms":302626,"num_turns":6,"result":"Now I have sufficient context. Let me produce the full detailed median-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Core finding (31.3% instability) and semi-synthetic validation framework survive intact.\n  Meta-critique (Claim 2) is viewed by at least one reviewer as \"obvious in retrospect\" —\n  enrichment≈1.0 is unsurprising to anyone already skeptical of web-overlap labels.\n  GSM1K correlation (Claim 4d, N=33) is flagged as underpowered and demoted to supplementary.\n  One reviewer notes pseudo R²=0.0007 is suspiciously low and asks about model specification.\n  Actionable takeaway is insufficient — \"so what should practitioners do?\"\n  Rebuttal strategy: emphasize 31.3% + controls (plan_018/019/022/027) as the load-bearing\n  contribution; soften Claim 2 from \"fundamental blind spot\" to \"first empirical quantification\";\n  drop GSM1K from headline; add concrete DIF audit protocol for benchmark maintainers.\n  Acceptance probability 0.30–0.55; likely Findings-level (score 3.0–3.5) without strong rebuttal.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      MH-DIF analysis on METABENCH MMLU (5,227 models × 12,508 items).\n      Temporal cohort (2023 vs 2024-H1), ability-quintile split, Li et al. proxy validation,\n      within-family confound control, domain-specificity analysis.\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n      temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n      ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      ability_enrichment: 1.19\n      within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n      within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n      domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n      sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，31.3% 核心发现成立并通过审稿。时间队列 DIF 反映了真实的 item 功能变化，\n      而非统计伪迹（随机分割仅 0.18%）。Li et al. 标签的 enrichment≈0.96 确认了 web-overlap 标签\n      与 DIF 正交——这在 median 档被接受为预期结果而非 DIF 失败的证据。能力五分位 C%=2.9% 远低于\n      时间队列的 31.3%，证明 DIF 信号是时间效应而非能力分层伪迹。within-family Llama-2v3 的\n      C%=61.3% 较高因为能力差距大（d=-0.99），但在 plan_027 匹配后降至 28.3%。\n      domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 表示领域改进与 DIF 有弱关联，但 plan_019 分解证明仅解释 2.4pp。\n      审稿人接受该发现为稳健的，但一位审稿人质疑 ETS C 的 |Δ_MH|≥1.5 阈值是否适合 LLM 人群，\n      要求看不同阈值下的结果（引向 plan_018）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary — C/B/A 分布 across 12,508 items\"\n      - \"Table 2: Cohort × DIF cross-tabulation (2023 N=1,080 vs 2024 N=807)\"\n      - \"Table 3: Domain-specificity — top/bottom 10 subjects by C%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: |Δ_MH| distribution histogram with ETS A/B/C cutoffs marked\"\n      - \"Fig 2: Subject C% vs subject accuracy delta scatter (ρ=0.307)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的核心实验，在 median 档完全成立。31.3% C% 经受住了所有 robustness 检验（阈值、\n      多重检验、架构、能力分解、模型独立性）。审稿人的主要挑战不在于数字本身，而在于\n      \"31% instability 意味着什么\"——是否有 actionable 的下游影响。enrichment≈0.96 对 Claim 2\n      来说是关键证据，但在 median 档审稿人可能认为这个 null result 本身并不令人惊讶。\n\n  - name: rl_robustness_validation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      验证 DIF 对 RL 训练模型的鲁棒性。在 METABENCH 中分离 SFT-only、alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)、\n      reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO) 模型，比较 DIF 检测一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      sft_only_cohort_n: 312\n      alignment_rl_cohort_n: 477\n      reasoning_rl_n_available: 13\n      dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_alignrl: 0.72\n      dif_flag_jaccard_sft_vs_full: 0.85\n      reasoning_rl_added_c_pct_change: -0.4\n      constat_auroc_on_sft: 0.68\n      constat_auroc_on_rl: 0.53\n      mink_auroc_on_sft: 0.61\n      mink_auroc_on_rl: 0.47\n      tost_equivalence_dif_retention: \"p=0.08, inconclusive\"\n      bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_dif_vs_constat: \"[-0.05, 0.18]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，DIF 对 alignment-RL 模型表现稳定（Jaccard=0.72），因为 DPO/ORPO 不改变\n      NLL gap 结构。但 reasoning-RL 样本仅 13 个模型，严重不足以支撑任何统计结论。\n      将 13 个 reasoning-RL 模型加入 focal 队列后 C% 变化仅 -0.4pp，技术上\"稳健\"但\n      审稿人正确指出这不等于验证——13 个模型被 800+ 其他模型淹没。TOST 等价性检验\n      不显著（p=0.08），留下不确定性。传统检测器（ConStat、Min-K%）在 RL 模型上\n      AUROC 下降约 0.10-0.15，但 CI 宽，bootstrap 差异含零。\n      在 median 档这个实验被认为\"不够有力\"——N=13 reasoning-RL 的限制被视为致命缺陷，\n      整个 RL robustness 论述被降级为 future work 而非正式 claim。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: DIF flag overlap across SFT/alignment-RL/reasoning-RL cohort compositions\"\n      - \"Table: Per-detector AUROC comparison (DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K%) across model types\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Receiver operating characteristic curves for 3 detectors × 3 model subsets\"\n    analysis: >\n      N=13 reasoning-RL 模型是不可克服的瓶颈。在 median 档审稿人接受 alignment-RL 部分但\n      认为核心 claim（DIF 对 reasoning-RL 鲁棒）未被验证。这个实验最终不进入 main body，\n      在 limitations 中提及为\"initial evidence, insufficient for formal claim\"。\n      GPU 预算 100h 大部分用于推理 10-15 个开源 GRPO/PPO 模型跑 MMLU，结果数据量不够\n      支撑统计检验。\n\n  - name: constat_perturbation_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003a\n    description: >\n      独立评估 ConStat 式 perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的检测能力。\n      生成 200+ MMLU 题目的语义等价改写，比较原始/改写表现，FDR 控制检测。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_reformulated: 237\n      n_models_tested: 50\n      perturbation_detection_rate_overall: 0.14\n      perturbation_detection_rate_suspected_contaminated: 0.23\n      perturbation_detection_rate_clean: 0.09\n      fdr_controlled_detections: 34\n      mean_accuracy_drop_original_to_perturbed: 0.031\n      mean_accuracy_drop_suspected: 0.058\n      mean_accuracy_drop_clean: 0.012\n      constat_dif_flag_overlap_jaccard: 0.11\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，ConStat 式方法在 MMLU 4 选 1 格式上受限——perturbation 空间受限于\n      问题改写而非选项重排（MMLU 选项本身是固定的），导致 signal 较弱。\n      整体检测率仅 14%，在疑似污染 items 上稍高（23%）但仍远低于 DIF 的 31.3%。\n      accuracy drop 均值仅 3.1pp，信噪比低。ConStat 与 DIF 标记的 Jaccard=0.11 极低，\n      验证了两种方法捕获不同维度的信号——ConStat 检测个体模型的 verbatim 记忆，\n      DIF 检测群体层面的差异功能。这个结果在 median 档被认为\"有信息量但不 compelling\"，\n      最终作为 baseline comparison 放入 appendix/supplementary 而非 main body。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: ConStat detection rates by contamination status (Li et al. labels)\"\n      - \"Table: ConStat vs DIF flag confusion matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Accuracy drop distribution (original → perturbed) for flagged vs unflagged items\"\n    analysis: >\n      ConStat 在 MMLU 上表现不佳的根本原因是 MMLU 的 4-choice MCQ 格式限制了 perturbation\n      效果。改写后语义保持但表面形式变化有限，模型的正确率下降不够大。在 median 档\n      审稿人可能质疑 perturbation 质量，但更根本的问题是 ConStat 设计用于检测 verbatim\n      记忆而非 differential functioning，所以低 overlap 是 expected 而非 failure。\n      这个实验消耗 80h GPU 但产出有限，属于 negative-but-informative result。\n\n  - name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n    plan_id: plan_003b\n    description: >\n      独立评估 DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上的检测能力。\n      10-15 个开源模型每题生成 50 次 response，计算 generation variance，检测双峰分布。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_tested: 12\n      n_items_evaluated: 12508\n      bimodal_detection_rate: 0.07\n      bimodal_on_dif_c_items: 0.09\n      bimodal_on_non_dif_items: 0.06\n      variance_score_dif_c_mean: 0.342\n      variance_score_non_dif_mean: 0.318\n      variance_diff_effect_size_d: 0.12\n      dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.04\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上表现最差。4-choice MCQ 的 generation\n      variance 本质上受限于离散分布——模型要么选对要么选错，temperature sampling 在\n      MCQ 上产生的 variance 主要反映模型 confidence 而非 contamination signal。\n      bimodal 检测率仅 7%，DIF-C 与 non-DIF items 差异极小（d=0.12），overlap Jaccard=0.04\n      说明两种方法几乎完全独立。DVD 设计初衷是开放生成任务（如代码生成），在 MCQ 上\n      先天不适用。在 median 档这个结果迅速确认 DVD 不适用于 MMLU 评估，实验结论明确但\n      对论文贡献有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Generation variance summary statistics by DIF category\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Variance score distributions for DIF-C vs non-DIF items (near-complete overlap)\"\n    analysis: >\n      DVD 在 MCQ 上的理论限制是预期内的——generation variance 对 MCQ 格式本身不适配。\n      这 70h GPU 产出 negative result，在论文中仅作为一句话提及（\"DVD generation variance\n      is designed for open-ended tasks and shows near-zero signal on MCQ benchmarks\"）。\n      审稿人不会挑战这个结论，但也不会因此给分。\n\n  - name: ensemble_fusion\n    plan_id: plan_003c\n    description: >\n      融合 DIF + ConStat + DVD 为多信号集成检测器。2-of-3 majority voting 和加权融合。\n    expected_results:\n      ensemble_attempted: false\n      reason: \"plan_003a 和 plan_003b 个体信号太弱，无法构建有意义的集成\"\n      constat_standalone_auroc: 0.58\n      dvd_standalone_auroc: 0.52\n      dif_standalone_auroc: \"N/A (group-level, not model-level)\"\n      notes: \"DIF 是群体层面方法，无法与 ConStat/DVD 在 item-model 粒度融合\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，ensemble fusion 因为两个根本问题而未完成：(1) plan_003a 和 plan_003b\n      的个体信号太弱（ConStat AUROC≈0.58, DVD AUROC≈0.52），集成无法从噪声中提取\n      信号；(2) 更根本的是，DIF 是群体层面方法（检测 item 在两个群体间的差异功能），\n      而 ConStat/DVD 是模型层面方法（检测单个模型的记忆），粒度不匹配导致融合框架\n      概念上不连贯。在 median 档这个实验被正确放弃，论文叙事从 \"ensemble detection\"\n      转向 \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"，避免了强行融合不可融合的方法。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble fusion 的失败不是实验失败而是概念重构——认识到 DIF 和 per-model detectors\n      回答不同问题（\"which items function differently\" vs \"which models memorized\"）。\n      这个认识反而强化了 Claim 2（meta-critique），因为它揭示了粒度不匹配问题。\n      在 median 档，审稿人不会批评未做的集成，因为论文已经 pivot 到 diagnostic lens 叙事。\n\n  - name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      在 GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，使用 GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。\n      三步：(1) GSM8K temporal DIF, (2) semi-synthetic validation, (3) GSM1K 相关。\n    expected_results:\n      step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n      step1_n_items: 1319\n      step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      step3_n_models: 33\n      step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n      step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n      step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n      step3_spearman_p: 0.020\n      step3_partial_r: -0.385\n      step3_partial_p: 0.027\n      step3_bca_ci_pearson: \"[-0.714, -0.155]\"\n      step3_bca_ci_spearman: \"[-0.687, -0.031]\"\n      step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n      step3_cook_d_max: \"Deepseek-math-7b-rl\"\n      step3_leave_one_out_r_range: \"[-0.537, -0.374]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，GSM8K Step 1 和 Step 2 成功复制——temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 的\n      31.3%（合理，GSM8K 是单一数学领域，能力结构更均质），semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818\n      确认框架跨 benchmark 可移植性。\n\n      关键争议在 Step 3：r=-0.478 (p=0.005) 看似显著，但 N=33 导致 CI 极宽——\n      Pearson CI 上界 |r|=0.155 意味着真实效应可能很小，Spearman CI 上界 |ρ|=0.031\n      意味着几乎可以为零。在 median 档，至少一位审稿人指出：(a) N=33 严重不足，\n      (b) GSM1K contamination gap 本身是 proxy 而非 ground truth，(c) 反向相关的\n      因果解释不唯一——DIF-C items 可能仅因为更难而使 contaminated 模型在上面得分低。\n\n      审稿人建议将 Step 3 从 headline results 降级为 supplementary evidence。这与\n      median 档的 \"GSM1K correlation is discounted\" 假设一致。论文将 Step 3 用作\n      \"suggestive cross-benchmark evidence\" 而非 \"confirmation of contamination resistance\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GSM8K temporal DIF summary (1,319 items × 6,702 models)\"\n      - \"Table: Semi-synthetic ΔTPR dose-response on GSM8K\"\n      - \"Table: GSM1K correlation statistics with CIs (moved to appendix in median)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GSM8K |Δ_MH| distribution vs MMLU comparison\"\n      - \"Fig: DIF-C item score vs GSM1K gap scatter (N=33, wide CIs visible)\"\n    analysis: >\n      GSM8K 复制的 Step 1+2 在 median 档完全成立并进入 main body。Step 3 是 median 档\n      最大的弱点之一——N=33, wide CIs, causal ambiguity。在 rebuttal 中不应试图捍卫\n      Step 3 的 headline 地位，而应主动将其定位为 \"preliminary cross-benchmark evidence\n      that motivates larger-scale replication\"。这样做既诚实又保护了论文的 credibility。\n\n  - name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      在 METABENCH MMLU 上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型（general factor + 57 subject-specific factors），\n      选择 anchor items，通过 fixed-parameter calibration 进行 equating。\n    expected_results:\n      bifactor_convergence: false\n      convergence_attempts: 3\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_rmsea: 0.089\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_cfi: 0.71\n      partial_fit_5_subjects_srmr: 0.112\n      full_57_factor_status: \"non-convergence after 5000 EM iterations\"\n      anchor_item_selection: \"N/A — model did not converge\"\n      equating_completed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，bifactor IRT 在 MMLU 上面临两个结构性障碍：(1) 57 个 subject-specific\n      factors 的参数空间巨大（12,508 items × 58 factors），EM 算法在 5,227 个 models 上\n      无法收敛；(2) 即使在 5 个 subjects 子集上部分拟合，fit indices 也不达标\n      （RMSEA>0.08, CFI<0.90），因为 MMLU 本身是知识测验而非心理测量量表——item 之间\n      的 local independence 假设被 subject 内的 topic clustering 严重违反。\n      plan_013 的 Q3 分析已显示 within-subject 有 11.3% 的 item pairs 违反 local independence。\n      bifactor 模型无法修复这个根本问题。实验被 kill 前仅消耗约 15h GPU（远低于 50h 预算），\n      合理止损。在 median 档论文将此作为 limitations 中 \"empirical observation\" 的一部分，\n      motivation for future multidimensional IRT work。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Bifactor 失败是 median 档 \"Claim 3 (regeneration) dropped entirely\" 的直接原因。\n      没有 bifactor equating，就没有 principled 的 anchor item 选择方法，整个 regeneration\n      pipeline 缺乏基础。这个 negative result 对论文 framing 的影响是积极的——\n      它迫使论文从 \"we can fix benchmarks\" 转向 \"we can diagnose benchmarks\"，\n      后者更诚实也更 defensible。\n\n  - name: item_generation_calibration\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      为 DIF-flagged MMLU 题目生成替代题目，通过 student simulation 进行难度校准。\n    expected_results:\n      experiment_executed: false\n      reason: \"plan_005 (bifactor IRT) failed — no calibration targets available\"\n      dependency_chain_broken: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，plan_005 的失败导致 plan_006 从未启动。没有 bifactor 模型提供的\n      item parameter targets，LLM 生成的替代题目无法与原始题目在 IRT 参数空间对齐。\n      仅靠 CTT difficulty (p-value) 匹配不足以保证 construct equivalence。\n      这 200h GPU 预算完全未使用。论文中不提及此实验（未执行 = 无结果可报告），\n      但 regeneration 方向作为 \"promising future work\" 出现在 conclusion 中。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_006 的缺失不影响 median 档论文质量——paper 已 pivot away from regeneration。\n      但审稿人中有一位可能会问 \"so what should practitioners do with these DIF flags?\"\n      without replacement items, the answer is weak. This is one of the 1-2 claims\n      needing softening in median tier — the diagnostic lens framing needs a concrete\n      protocol (DIF audit checklist) to fill the actionability gap.\n\n  - name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      实现 Sinharay et al. (2006) 累积贝叶斯 DIF 先验。模拟 4 次连续 benchmark\n      administration，展示累积证据下的 power 提升。\n    expected_results:\n      simulation_only: true\n      single_admin_power_delta_10: 0.42\n      cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.58\n      cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.71\n      cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.79\n      effect_size_simulated: 1.0\n      n_per_admin: 100\n      prior_shrinkage_on_small_effects: 0.35\n      bayesian_fpr_vs_frequentist: \"0.028 vs 0.042\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，cumulative Bayesian DIF 是纯模拟实验，展示理论上的 power 提升：\n      单次 administration 对 medium effects (δ=1.0) 的 power 仅 0.42，但 3 次累积后\n      达到 0.71——超过了 MH 在 N=80, δ=1.4 时的 0.68。Bayesian shrinkage 还将小效应\n      的 FPR 从 0.042 降至 0.028。但这全部是模拟结果，没有在 METABENCH 真实数据上\n      验证（因为只有 2 个时间点，不够 4 次 administration）。在 median 档审稿人承认\n      理论价值但认为 \"simulation without real validation is supplementary at best\"。\n      这个实验被放入 appendix，作为 future monitoring framework 的理论基础。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): Power by # administrations × effect size (simulation grid)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): Power accumulation curves — 1 to 4 administrations at δ={0.5, 1.0, 1.5}\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cumulative Bayesian DIF 在 median 档被视为 \"nice to have\" 而非必要。审稿人不会\n      批评这个 idea 本身，但会认为没有 real-data validation 就无法支撑论文 claim。\n      零 GPU 消耗（纯模拟），投入产出比合理作为 supplementary material。\n\n  - name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      分析 benchmark 在 item 替换下的 validity degradation。\n      定义 validity metrics，模拟渐进替换（5%-50%），建立理论 bounds。\n    expected_results:\n      replacement_items_available: false\n      degradation_only_analysis: true\n      removal_5pct_rho: 0.9994\n      removal_10pct_rho: 0.9987\n      removal_20pct_rho: 0.9971\n      removal_31pct_rho: 0.9965\n      removal_50pct_rho: 0.9921\n      shr_degradation_31pct: -0.0015\n      construct_coverage_31pct: \"54/57 subjects retained ≥70% items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，由于 plan_005/006 失败，无替代 items 可用，graceful degradation\n      只能分析 removal（不含 replacement）。结果高度积极：即使移除 31% DIF-C items，\n      ranking stability 仍 ρ=0.9965——这直接支撑了 \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。\n      50% 移除后仍 ρ>0.99，证明 MMLU 有极大的 measurement redundancy。\n\n      但这个分析本质上与 plan_017 高度重叠（plan_017 已报告 ρ=0.996-0.999）。\n      在 median 档审稿人不会为 redundant results 给额外分数。graceful degradation\n      的独特贡献——construct coverage 分析（54/57 subjects retain ≥70% items）——\n      是一个 small addition，放入 appendix。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): Ranking stability (ρ) and SHR as function of removal rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): ρ vs removal rate curve (near-horizontal at 0.99+ until 50%)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Graceful degradation 的核心发现已被 plan_017 部分报告。独立贡献有限但强化了\n      \"MMLU is massively redundant\" 的论点。在 median 档这作为 supplementary evidence\n      支持 Claim 4a (benchmark redundancy) 但不改变审稿评分。\n\n  - name: item_focused_trees\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      实现 Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees，将 model release date 作为\n      连续协变量替代 categorical cohort DIF。\n    expected_results:\n      n_items_analyzed: 12508\n      ift_flagged_items_pct: 28.7\n      ift_mh_c_overlap_jaccard: 0.61\n      ift_unique_flags_pct: 4.2\n      mh_unique_flags_pct: 6.8\n      temporal_trend_significant_items_pct: 22.3\n      linear_trend_dominant: true\n      nonlinear_trend_items_pct: 6.4\n      advantage_over_mh: \"avoids arbitrary cohort boundary; captures gradual drift\"\n      disadvantage_vs_mh: \"computationally expensive; interpretation less transparent\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，IFT 提供了 DIF 的连续视角——28.7% items 被标记，与 MH 的 31.3%\n      有 Jaccard=0.61 的重叠。IFT 额外发现 4.2% 的 items 有 gradual drift 但未达\n      MH 的 C 阈值（effect 在 B 区间逐渐累积），同时 MH 标记的 6.8% items 在 IFT 中\n      不显著（可能是 MH 对 cohort boundary 的特殊性敏感）。22.3% 的 items 显示\n      statistically significant 的时间趋势（非平坦 ICCs across release dates）。\n\n      在 median 档审稿人认为 IFT 是 \"interesting robustness check\" 但不构成独立贡献——\n      核心发现（~30% items 功能不稳定）无论用 MH 还是 IFT 都成立。IFT 的计算成本\n      （每个 item 一棵 tree，12,508 棵）远高于 MH，但额外信息有限。\n      放入 appendix 作为 method robustness 证据。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): MH vs IFT flag comparison — 2×2 contingency table\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig (Appendix): IFT-derived DIF effect trajectory for 5 example items across release dates\"\n    analysis: >\n      IFT 确认 MH 发现的 robustness 但不改变结论。在 median 档审稿人可能欣赏方法论\n      thoroughness 但不会因此提高 novelty 评分。零 GPU 消耗，作为 supplementary 的\n      cost-benefit 比合理。\n\n  - name: architecture_stratified_dif\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      在 architecture-homogeneous (decoder-only) 子群上运行 DIF，检验 IRT 模型拟合\n      是否改善、spurious DIF 是否减少。\n    expected_results:\n      decoder_only_n: 5226\n      decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n      non_decoder_n: 1\n      c_pct_decoder_only: 31.3\n      c_pct_full: 31.3\n      jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n      rpb_mean_decoder: 0.3993\n      rpb_mean_full: 0.3993\n      lz_misfit_pct_decoder: 98.0\n      lz_misfit_pct_full: 98.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，architecture stratification 产生了最 anticlimactic 但最 clean 的\n      结果：METABENCH MMLU 中 99.98% 的模型是 decoder-only，仅 1 个 encoder-decoder\n      模型 (AurelPx/Pegasus-7b-slerp)。移除它后所有指标完全不变——C% 相同，\n      Jaccard=1.0，rpb 分布相同，person misfit 相同。这彻底排除了 architecture\n      heterogeneity 作为 DIF 伪迹来源。\n\n      但同时暴露了一个 separate 问题：98% 的模型 |Lz|>2 表明 1D IRT 本身对 MMLU\n      严重 misspecified——这不是 architecture 的问题，而是 MMLU 57 subjects 的\n      多维性本身。在 median 档审稿人接受 architecture 不是问题，但可能追问\n      \"if 98% of models misfit the IRT model, how valid are MH results at all?\"\n      论文回应：MH 不依赖 IRT model fit，它直接条件化 total score，是非参数方法。\n      Lz misfit 是 IRT 的问题，不是 MH 的问题。这个辩护在 median 档被接受但留\n      lingering doubt。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Architecture composition of METABENCH MMLU\"\n      - \"Table: DIF results comparison — full vs decoder-only (identical)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: (Potentially omitted — showing identical results is not visually informative)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Plan_010 的结果在 median 档是 strong defense against a weak attack——architecture\n      heterogeneity 从未真正是个问题因为数据集本身就是 homogeneous。但作为 proactive\n      defense（提前排除审稿人可能的 concern），这是 good practice。结果进入 main body\n      作为一句话 + footnote：\"METABENCH is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n      excluding the one non-decoder model yields identical results (Jaccard=1.0).\"\n\n  - name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      在真实 METABENCH response matrix 中注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 检测力。\n      变化注入参数：contamination prevalence, exploitation rate, focal group size。\n    expected_results:\n      temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n      temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n      temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.990\n      temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.000\n      temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10: 0.616\n      cross_subject_matching_fpr_stable: true\n      cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.000\n      within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.186\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      n_clean_items: 500\n      n_injected_items: 200\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，semi-synthetic 实验是 Claim 3 的核心证据，成功展示了三个关键结果：\n      (1) DIF 对 injected contamination 有明确的 dose-response（ΔTPR 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0\n      单调增加），证明 DIF 能够检测 differential contamination；\n      (2) cross-subject matching 完全消除 FPR inflation（ΔFPR=0.000 across all 5 tested\n      subjects），而 standard/within-subject matching 导致 FPR 从 0.30 膨胀到 0.62——\n      这是 matching variable contamination 效应的直接证明；\n      (3) 基线 FPR=0.314 接近 plan_001 的 temporal C%=31.3%，这不是巧合——它反映了\n      真实数据中已存在的 temporal DIF（注入在 existing DIF 之上叠加）。\n\n      在 median 档，至少一位审稿人欣赏 cross-subject matching 的 innovation（\"subtle\n      and general insight about matching variable contamination\"），但另一位认为\n      semi-synthetic injection 过于简化（\"incorrect→correct flipping doesn't model\n      real contamination mechanisms\"）。论文在 limitations 中 acknowledge 这一点。\n      Semi-synthetic framework 被一位审稿人视为 \"useful but niche\"——对 DIF 研究者有价值\n      但对一般 NLP 社区影响有限。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: ΔTPR dose-response across exploitation rates p ∈ {0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 1.0}\"\n      - \"Table: FPR comparison — standard vs cross-subject vs within-subject matching\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curves for 3 matching strategies (FPR and TPR vs exploitation rate p)\"\n      - \"Fig: FPR inflation under standard matching vs stable FPR under cross-subject matching\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic validation 在 median 档是论文中技术最 clean 的贡献。cross-subject\n      matching 的 ΔFPR=0.000 结果是 elegant 的，提供了 concrete methodological recommendation。\n      但 \"niche\" 评价意味着这个贡献的 impact 被 discount——EMNLP 审稿人期望看到\n      broader implications for the NLP community, not just psychometric methodology refinement。\n      在 rebuttal 中应强调 framework 的 reusability：any future item-level detector\n      can use this semi-synthetic protocol for controlled validation。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"43ea3076-440c-4e48-9471-1c78687f25f0","total_cost_usd":0.68506925,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35957,"cache_read_input_tokens":205836,"output_tokens":13716,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35957,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":10469,"cache_read_input_tokens":46827,"cache_creation_input_tokens":971,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":971},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":14380,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.014485,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":7,"outputTokens":13716,"cacheReadInputTokens":205836,"cacheCreationInputTokens":35957,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6705842499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"68a1cdf0-2034-46c9-aed4-f90b5f72efd5"}
